        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most marble counters, Tenax Proseal is the best balance of stain protection, invisibility and price. For high-value white marble near a cooktop, Dry-Treat Stain-Proof Plus earns its premium. For bathrooms and showers, StoneTech BulletProof does the job without solvent fumes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
